OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over assault at Celtic
OL,4,Aand Hearts title decider
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested and charged
OL,7,Fover an assault at the Celtic v Hearts
OL,8,Ftitle decider at Celtic Park.
OL,10,FThe game on 16 May saw scores of fans
OL,11,Frun onto the pitch in injury time,
OL,12,Fafter Celtic scored a third goal that
OL,13,Fclinched a 3-1 win and the Premiership
OL,14,Ftitle.
OL,16,FTrouble also occurred in Glasgow's
OL,17,FTrongate area after the game, with two
OL,18,Fpolice officers seriously injured and
OL,19,Fthree members of the public needing
OL,20,Fhospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
